WEBVTT

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.040
The sun sets on every era.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:15.250
Unsightly things, tainted things...

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:15.250
Everything is burned away.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.700
The end of everything

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.700
is enveloped...in red.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.330
Isn't it pretty, Brother?

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.500
Can we touch the sunset?

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:32.540
If I touched it,

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:32.540
would it be hot, Brother?

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.500
Yes, it would be.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.830
But I still want to try

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.830
and touch it a little.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.410
I mean, it's so pretty.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.870
Yuki... I want to tell you.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.040
What is beautiful

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.040
is not this world.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:59.200
But the way in which

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:59.200
your eyes see the world.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:46.080
WORLD'S END

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:50.200
You must do what you must.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.290
What I must do.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.620
Huh?!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.290
I want you to kill me...

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.290
with your hands.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.370
What are you doing?!

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.660
Weren't you going to retrieve

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.660
your anti-vampire gun?!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.500
I'm not able to use it right now.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.000
Huh?

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.040
Then it's best to stay hidden.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.330
You've only just awakened.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.620
It's too reckless to think of

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.620
fighting without a weapon.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.580
But I want to fight!

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.080
Then let me put it another way.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.040
Lady Yuki, I beseech you.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.250
Please stop your righteous behavior.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.250
It's meaningless.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.410
Souen...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.950
Our master has given us orders.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.040
To protect you from

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.040
Rido Kuran at all cost.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:04:00.450
Yuki, I do not want unsightly things

00:03:55.450 --> 00:04:00.450
reflected in your eyes.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:07.620
But, Rido Kuran...the signs of

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:07.620
his awakening was the worst of it.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.620
What a disgusting taste!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:19.290
Something is lacking, after all...

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:19.290
with cheap blood like this.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.120
The only thing that excites me is...

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.870
Juri, your blood.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.870
Please let me go.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:36.290
When faced by a Pureblood,

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:36.290
a vampire's powers become sealed.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.790
In order to protect Yuki,

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:44.410
it was necessary to create

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:44.410
a pawn to oppose him.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.370
One who would never betray her.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:56.040
But at that time, although things

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:56.040
were going exactly as I planned,

00:04:56.120 --> 00:05:00.500
I felt hurt for the first time...

00:04:56.120 --> 00:05:00.500
a burning, scorching pain.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:05.200
You are precisely the one

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:05.200
Rido Kuran is after, Princess.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:09.200
Please cooperate

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:09.200
and leave this place.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.790
I know...and that's why...!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:17.250
That's enough!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:17.250
Think of the position you're in!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:19.870
It's going to be a difficult battle.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.540
Hanabusa!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.410
That's fine with you, right?

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.290
It's from the main gate!

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:38.500
This is a losing proposition...trying to

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:38.500
keep Yuki Cross from getting hurt.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:40.500
You're wrong.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:46.410
If someone special to Lord Kaname

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:46.410
gets hurt, he will suffer.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.290
I don't want to hurt Lord Kaname.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.500
Hmm...

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:57.410
Then perhaps I should have gone

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:57.410
with Dorm President Kuran.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.160
Akatsuki...

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.830
Damn... I'm out of bullets.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.700
I think I should've

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.700
brought my sword.

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:19.870
Mr. Yagari!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.370
You guys...

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:31.620
Here, your mentor is getting pounded.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:31.620
Why didn't you get here sooner?

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.040
Are you all right?!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:35.250
Who are they?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:41.290
Those are Level E vampires who were

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:41.290
kept by the Society in absolute secrecy.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.790
They're coming.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.410
Headmaster!

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:52.120
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:58.830
Did you remember about Juri...

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:58.830
I mean, your real mother?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.750
I see.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:08.870
Everyone, please protect Yuki...

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:08.870
Rather, Cross Academy.

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.250
I will not allow you to go any further!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.450
Leave them to me.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:32.330
That's crazy! How can he take on

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:32.330
so many of them alone?!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.500
Headmaster!

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.160
It's not Headmaster.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.160
Call me Father.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.250
Father...

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.120
Father!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.660
That reckless old man...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.330
He is trying to

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.330
protect the academy.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.500
Let's go...

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.500
to wherever Rido Kuran is!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.120
Are you sure?

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:15.500
That is what I must do...

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.290
to protect this academy!

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.950
You may not be blood-related,

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.950
but you're his daughter, all right.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.750
You both have

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.750
the same recklessness.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:32.250
Don't worry. I won't let that old man

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:32.250
be the only one to work.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:36.370
You guys are late.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:38.620
Have you found Rido?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.830
No need to even look.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.330
He has really bad taste.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.620
He's too easy to track.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.950
Sir Ichio...

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:54.370
Blood... I have come to get blood.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:59.290
Hmm... And what would

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:59.290
you give in return?

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.620
Well...

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:07.450
Kaien Cross was extremely stubborn

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:07.450
and I could not get him to comply, but...

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.330
I released Level E vampires,

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.330
which I had kept around,

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.450
onto the academy.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.160
It is a matter of time

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.160
before it is destroyed.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.000
Well done.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.290
Sir Ichio, my reward...

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.370
What's your rush?

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:30.040
Vampire blood rejuvenates humans.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:36.290
Sir Ichio, you promised me

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:36.290
eternal beauty!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:39.580
A person who sells

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:39.580
his friends for personal gain...

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.290
How can such a person

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.290
even speak of beauty?

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:48.200
Let alone ask for blood

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:48.200
when he is a human!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.370
Blood... Blood!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.160
Hurry! Hurry!

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:55.830
You disgust me.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:05.950
Huh?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.370
This is the pits.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.410
This smell...!

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.290
Huh?!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.370
I've been waiting for you, Juri.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.830
You've grown so beautiful, Yuki.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:57.410
Hey!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.500
Huh?

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:03.250
So strong and refined...

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:03.250
that it is blinding.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.750
Lord Kaname Kuran!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.120
I'm sorry, Kaname.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:16.700
I'm happy. Nothing gives me more joy

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:16.700
than seeing you grown up.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:18.620
I'm really happy.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.540
Let Sir Ichio know!

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.040
Huh?!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.410
Fly free...Yuki!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.500
No matter how far you fly away...

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:37.450
You will always be the only

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:37.450
and most precious girl in the world.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.370
I'm so glad you came, Juri.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:48.580
Are you so eager to

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:48.580
become one with me?

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:49.830
Huh?!

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.040
We are your opponents!

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:53.950
I will get you for what you did!

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.370
Such fools.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.750
Why—?!

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:09.870
You are all vampires.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:09.870
You cannot lay a hand on a Pureblood.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:17.620
I really don't want to ruin

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:17.620
this special night by being boorish.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.410
So you guys can have your fun.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:26.950
No!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.830
Stop it, Rido!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.410
L-Let go of me!

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.910
Oh...this is Juri's smell.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.870
At this rate...

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.620
What I must do is...

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.580
Stop...!!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:15.830
Artemis Rod!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:20.120
The Pureblood Princess wielded

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:20.120
an anti-vampire weapon?!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.250
I am a Guardian!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.580
I will protect this academy!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.450
Not only the Day Class students...

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.330
but the Night Class as well.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.910
That's my Juri...

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.410
No, Juri's daughter!

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:45.250
All right! Get away from those people!

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.790
You have more gumption than Juri.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:03.330
Juri was more docile than you.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:03.330
Yes, when I first drank her blood.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.200
Huh?!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:10.910
Yuki Cross!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.370
Stop!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.040
Hanabusa!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:28.290
Come on... Cry out for help.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:34.500
Juri did. The first time

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:34.500
I drank her blood...

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:38.410
She cried out in tears,

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:38.410
"Haruka... Haruka..."

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.870
That was a masterpiece.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:41.950
What...?

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.700
Call out the name

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.700
of the one you love.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.120
The one I love...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.950
Huh?

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.120
Zero?

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:09.200
Get your filthy hands off her!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.040
Where are you going?

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.040
I was thinking of

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.040
shamelessly running away.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.790
I see. That's very wise.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.750
I cannot be turned to ash yet.

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:49.410
If you were going to your "god,"

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.080
he's probably been bitten to shreds

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.080
by the beast which I carefully nurtured.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.200
God, eh...

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.910
Was I not suitable

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.910
for your purpose?

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:06.870
It wasn't that. Simply, you were

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:06.870
someone we could not manage.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.620
Rido Kuran is a fool.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:16.750
As long as he is fed,

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:16.750
he can be controlled.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.830
- However...

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.830
- Let's end the conversation here.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.200
Will you let me take care of it?

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:44.950
Ichijo.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:49.250
As a vampire, I betrayed you.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:55.950
However, as your friend,

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:55.950
I will never betray you.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.330
Let me prove that to you.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.000
Thank you, Kaname.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.330
Takuma...

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:46.040
Do you intend to point that blade

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:46.040
towards me, Takuma?

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.620
I'm not trying to beg for my life.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:58.000
But I've always hoped that you would

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:58.000
take over the Senate after me.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:07.080
Let us end this...along with

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:07.080
the Senate that you so loved.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.790
In any plan, there is

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.790
always the unexpected.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.910
Pawns positioned to

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.910
protect what I hold dear...

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.870
That is all I expected of them...

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:37.870
But they were different

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:37.870
from what I had sought.

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:45.870
Yet they showed me even greater effort...

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:45.870
even greater radiance...

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.870
My battle is over.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:04.290
Have you fulfilled

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:04.290
your duty, Zero Kiryu?

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.370
Zero!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:20.250
Zero... You consumed Ichiru...

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.790
My, how dangerous...

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.000
You monster!

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:35.950
Zero!

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:37.200
What's happening?

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:39.410
His power is out of control?

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.160
Kiryu!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:42.450
This is bad.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:00.330
Zero!

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:06.700
That's the limit of an ex-human

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:06.700
even if he consumes his twin.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:07.790
Rido!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:14.330
Your human vessel obtained

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:14.330
more power than it could handle.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.750
There's no way it could

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.750
get accustomed to it fast enough.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:19.200
Zero!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.250
Yuki...

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.620
Use your Artemis Rod

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.620
and cut me!

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.120
Zero!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.330
Are you in your right mind?!

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.830
I'm not!

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.830
That's why I'm telling you!

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:44.790
That's the only way to control

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:44.790
my power that is running wild!

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:47.580
But Artemis Rod is...

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.620
Yuki, that is not a weapon

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.620
that will kill me.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:55.410
Remember our promise...

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:02.830
If at any time...I go berserk...

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:02.830
use this...

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.910
Zero!

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:21.450
This pain...

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.500
You...must live

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.500
and fulfill your goal!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:32.000
...is proof...that Ichiru

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:32.000
lives on inside me.

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.410
Kiryu!

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:37.330
The Bloody Rose...

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.410
At last, we are one.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:51.790
Interesting...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.450
Fine. I'll play with you

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.450
as much as you want.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.620
Kill me as often as you want.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.160
I shall resurrect

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.160
as often as I want.

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:04.580
I will...live and fulfill!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:21.620
Kiryu...

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:27.410
That light...is so ill-matched

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:27.410
with the vampire's night.

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:04.200
Next time:

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:04.200
"Vampire Knight"
